---
description: Never apply Prisma migrations or other database schema changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Do not migrate the database

Never run commands that change the database schema or data. That includes `prisma migrate deploy`, `prisma migrate dev`, `prisma db push`, `prisma db execute`, and `prisma db seed`.

When a schema change is needed, edit `schema.prisma` and add the migration SQL file. Stop there. Tell the user the exact command to run themselves.

`prisma generate` is allowed. It only regenerates the local client.
